<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Logicon cut by Merrill.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Logicon cut by Merrill.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Merrill Lynch said it downgraded Logicon Inc to near-term neutral from accumulate and to long-term accumulate from buy.</p>
<p>-- The stock ended at 42-7/8 Wednesday.</p>
</text>
